        " رَجُلَيْنِ قَتَلاَ رَجُلاً قَالَ \"إِنْ شَاءَ أَوْلِيَاءُ اَلْمَقْتُولِ أَنْ يُؤَدُّوا دِيَةً وَ يَقْتُلُوهُمَا جَمِيعاً قَتَلُوهُمَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5217 - Dawud ibn Sirhan narrated from Abu Abdullah (as) regarding two men who killed another man.\nImam (as) said: \"If the heirs of the murdered person wish to pay the blood money (diyyah) and execute both of them, they may kill them both.\""
        ]
      }
